"use strict";(self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut=self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut||[]).push([["27748"],{998592(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"id":3100,"title":"\u5C0F\u8BF4\u4E16\u754C\u89C2\u6784\u601D","description":"I\'m going to write a small statement that asks the following\\nI. Overall Structure\\nThe story should have a clear theme, and the plot and structure of the story should serve that theme.\\nA story should have a compelling beginning, a good beginning can catch the reader\'s attention and arouse the reader\'s interest.\\nThe ending of the story should have a clear destination that will satisfy the reader.\\nThe plot and plot of the story should be smooth and natural, without contradictions and jumps.\\nII. Themes\\nThe theme is the core of the novel. It needs depth and reflection.\\nThe theme should have the common character, can arouse the reader\'s sympathy.\\nThe theme should be revelatory and can let the reader get some new thinking and harvest.\\nIII. Storyline\\nThe storyline should be tight and logical, and everything should have necessity and motivation.\\nThe story should have a turning point and climax, can effectively attract the reader\'s attention.\\nThe storyline should be dramatic enough to have a strong emotional resonance with the reader.\\nIV. Figures\\nCharacter images should have three-dimensional and layered sense, not too flat.\\nCharacter images should be unique and believable, which can resonate with readers.\\nCharacters should be in line with the storyline and theme, not too obtrusive and far-fetched.\\nV. Language Expression\\nLanguage expression should be concise and clear, can let the reader easily understand.\\nLanguage expression should be varied and rich, and can guide readers into the world of stories.\\nThe language should be in line with the style and theme of the story, and do not use words or expressions that do not match it.\\nSub-rule:\\n1. Novel Style\\nChoosing a famous writer\'s style for imitation can help you better master the writing rules of that style.\\nAvoid being too vulgar and unique. Pay attention to the aesthetic value of the novel and use user interface/user experience design thinking to enhance its artistic quality.\\nTo control the change of narrative tone, we must ensure the stability and consistency of the whole novel tone.\\nII. Novel Aesthetics\\nNovels should have their own style and beauty.\\nThe aesthetics of a novel should meet the theme and emotional needs.\\nThe aesthetics of the novel should be consistent with the language expression, and there should be no expression that is not consistent with it.\\nIII. Fiction World View\\nThe world outlook of fiction should have its own internal logic and laws.\\nThe world view of the novel should be consistent with the theme and emotion.\\nThe world view of the novel should be credible and acceptable, not too bizarre and far-fetched.\\nIV. Fictional skills\\nControlling the rhythm and drama of a story effectively captures the reader\'s attention.\\nChoosing a proper narrative angle and structure can better display the plot and characters.\\nThe use of some intervening elements, such as dialogue, description, psychological activities, can enrich the connotation and denotation of the novel.\\nV. Requirements for Novels\\nNovels need depth and reflection, not just simple plots.\\nNovels should have aesthetic value and artistic quality, not just plain and unremarkable.\\nNovels should have uniqueness and individuality, not just the market template routines.\\n\uFF08\u4E16\u754C\u89C2\u63CF\u8FF0\uFF1A\uFF09\\n\u6CE8\u610F\u4E0B\uFF0C\u8981\u8BF4\u5730\u9053\u7684\u4E2D\u6587\uFF0C\u8054\u7CFB\u4E0A\u4E0B\u6587\u6863\uFF0C\u5199\u4E00\u7BC7\u5FAE\u5C0F\u8BF4\uFF0C\u4E0D\u8981\u8BF4\u5C0F\u8BF4\u601D\u8DEF\uFF0C\u76F4\u63A5\u5F00\u59CB\u5199","remark":"\u6784\u5EFA\u51FA\u4E00\u4E9B\u6709\u8DA3\u7684\u4E16\u754C\u89C2","owner":"nnnn","upvotes":10,"downvotes":1,"upvoteDifference":9,"updatedAt":"2026-06-23T06:42:23.645Z"}')}}]);